21:["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"作者把 Agent 表示为 foundation model 与 scaffold 的组合，并用自主产生且提交更新的算子描述改进。这一视角将关注点放在经验如何转化为保留的系统变化，而不只看最终回答是否更好。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"综述先建立系统层面的形式化，再按更新对象和驱动信号梳理方法，将 model 改进与 scaffold 改进分成两大分支，并另设评测与 benchmark 入口。各类方法与代表论文之间建立了可追踪的索引。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"用库中的 Self-Rewarding 做分类演示：θ 表示会更新的 Model，Scaffold 包含固定 Rubric 和生成流程；Model 生成回答及判断，训练将偏好反馈变成下一版 θ。再用 DGM 对照：θ 固定，Agent Code 属于 Scaffold，修改后继续参与后续工作。输入是论文实验描述，输出是系统边界、状态与更新角色的分类记录，而非一个新算法。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"原文将 Agent 表示为 A_t=(θ_t,Σ_t)，Σ 包括 Prompt、Memory、Tools 和控制结构。执行过程 E 产生轨迹、Critique 或候选修改，U 将它们变成下一状态。符号的作用是清楚区分“产生反馈”与“提交更新”。仅有 A_(t+1)=U(…) 的写法，没有给出质量单调上升的定理，也没有说明 U 一定随轮数变化。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"A_t = (θ_t, Σ_t)\nΣ_t = (prompt_t, memory_t, tools_t, control_t)\nA_(t+1) = U(A_1:t, E(policy_t, context_t))"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：分散方法能否在共同系统框架中比较？→ Validation：综述将已有工作按组件、信号、应用与评价组织，讨论持久更新及开放问题。→ Answer：它提供概念综合与文献证据，未通过一个新受控实验验证所有 Self-improvement 机制有效。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"主要产出是组织文献的框架与研究地图，而非新的性能纪录。其价值在于把 prompt evolution、memory 积累、工具创建和参数学习放到可比较的坐标中，并连接应用、评测与尚未解决的问题。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
25:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"这篇 Survey 最适合作为阅读检查表：先写系统状态，再写更新与证据。本站五个 Evolution Targets 借助这种组件视角组织，但额外把 Loop Role 和 Recursive Gain 分开，以便避免把状态更新当作效果证明。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
26:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是论文描述足够详细，让读者辨认实际提交的状态。Many-agent 系统里，日志、缓存、Prompt 与参数的生命周期可能不同；缺少实现证据时，分类应保留 Unclear。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"本条核对了 arXiv 摘要与正文框架，未逐页通读 97 页全文。综述覆盖 self-improvement 的广义家族，不意味着每篇收录论文都实现了改进机制自身通过 recursion 获得提升，也不提供通用 RSI 已实现的实证。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Self-Improvements in Modern Agentic Systems: A Survey · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
27:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：选取十篇横跨权重、记忆和代码的论文。Day 3–5：由两位读者独立标注 Boundary、Target、Persistence 和 Role，并定位原文证据。Day 6–7：统计分歧，检查规则能否解决边界案例。此处复现的是分类可操作性，不是算法性能。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
28:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"找一篇在同一报告中同时包含单题 Refinement 和跨任务 Prompt Learning 的论文。若框架只能给整个论文一个互斥标签，就无法准确表达两个实验，说明需要 Variant 级记录。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
29:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究可执行的 Self-improvement 证据规范：让系统导出状态差分、更新来源和后续调用关系，由工具自动检查是否发生持久更新及 Recursive Reuse。相对已有 Survey 的文本分类，这将定义转为可复核的实验对象。真正难点是让不同实现共享功能语义，而非只统一字段名字。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2507.21046",{"href":"#reference-2507.21046","aria-label":"来源 2: A Survey of Self-Evolving Agents: What, When, How, and Where to Evolve on the Path to Artificial Super Intelligence","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2505.22954",{"href":"#reference-2505.22954","aria-label":"来源 3: Darwin Godel Machine: Open-Ended Evolution of Self-Improving Agents","children":["[",3,"]"]}],["$","a","2401.10020",{"href":"#reference-2401.10020","aria-label":"来源 4: Self-Rewarding Language Models","children":["[",4,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
